{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Breathbound\u00a0</i>is a sci-fi sandbox game blending survival-building and epic combat. On a dying alien wasteland, players\u2014as the last survivors\u2014must rebuild oxygen stations and defenses while battling enraged &quot;Star Dragons&quot; spawned by ecological collapse. The game features deep construction systems where every layout impacts survival, and unique dragon-taming combat\u2014befriend hatchlings or fend off enraged elders. Its core ecological balance system makes every choice dynamically alter the planet: hunt dragons for resources or restore their habitats to heal the ecosystem. Rebuilding civilization demands a delicate balance of technology and nature.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948650?t=1757685801","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948650/de2cf5c407a9a32e6288733de944543806b37e37/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757685801","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948650/e26e907490b10f6fc2a592d1976a219ff64b49e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757685801","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948650/e26e907490b10f6fc2a592d1976a219ff64b49e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757685801","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Breathbound\u00a0</i>is a sci-fi sandbox game blending survival-building and epic combat. On a dying alien wasteland, players\u2014as the last survivors\u2014must rebuild oxygen stations and defenses while battling enraged &quot;Star Dragons&quot; spawned by ecological collapse. The game features deep construction systems where every layout impacts survival, and unique dragon-taming combat\u2014befriend hatchlings or fend off enraged elders. Its core ecological 